  "description": "This 16x6.50-8 lawn mower tire kit (2 pcs, pre-mounted on rims with tubes) features 4-ply rubber, 620 lbs capacity, and turf-friendly tread—fits most mowers; verify fitment before ordering.\nFeatures\nCOMPATIBILITY & SPECIFICATIONS: The lawn mower tires kit fits most riding garden tractors with 16X6.50-8 tire size. Designed with a 4\" centered hub for precise installation. Tire Load Range: B/4 Ply (4PR), Rim Diameter: 8\", Section Width: 6.5\", Outer Diameter: 16\", Tread Depth: 0.24\" (6mm), Bearing Bore: 0.98\" (25mm), Max Load (2 Pack): 620 lbs, Max Inflation Pressure: 28 PSI. (Not for highway use.)\nTURF-FRIENDLY & HIGH-PERFORMANCE TREAD: The unique tread pattern boosts traction while minimizing lawn damage. The wide, flat footprint spreads pressure evenly, reduces noise, improves heat dissipation and water drainage, and gives you better handling, smoother ride, and quieter operation.\nHEAVY-DUTY 4-PLY TIRE: Made from quality natural rubber, these 4‑ply pneumatic 16X6.50-8 lawn mower tires deliver high load capacity and durability. You get dependable traction and smooth rolling, whether you're mowing a small yard or handling large acreage – stable, reliable performance every time.\nTUBELESS PRE-MOUNTED TIRE & WHEEL KIT: Fully assembled lawn tractor tires pre-fitted on matching rims, no inner tubes required. Built-in 0.98\" bearing bore on hub. Direct bolt-on replacement for your old wheels, no extra assembly or spare parts needed.\nPLEASE NOTE: This kit contains 2 pieces of 16X6.50-8 pneumatic tire and wheel assemblies for riding lawn tractors. Not for highway use. Always keep tire air pressure at standard 28 PSI while operating. Double-check your mower's tire size and rim dimensions against our specs before buying to ensure a proper fit.",
